== Effects ==
* If Isaac is in a room with enemies, [[rocks]] and rock-like obstacles will occasionally spawn [[Familiar#Blue Spiders|blue spiders]].
* Causes all rocks to spawn 0-2 blue spiders when destroyed.
* {{transformation contribution|Spider Baby}}

== Synergies ==
* {{i|Compost}} : Will double the current amount of [[blue spider]]s.
* {{i|D12}}: Due to the high tendency of replacing rocks with {{e|TNT}}, it allows for easy destruction of nearby rocks, resulting in lots of blue spiders.
* {{i|Leo}} / {{i|Mega Mush}} / {{i|Notched Axe}} / {{tf|Stompy}} / {{i|Sulfuric Acid}} / {{i|Terra}} / {{i|Thunder Thighs}}: As Isaac can break all reachable rocks, he can amass a lot of [[blue spider]]s.
* {{i|Mega Mush}} : When Isaac destroys [[block]]s it will produce [[blue spider]]s.

